C-side: A2D probe on nsense, a step from 0 to 1 V over 99..100 ns

model vsrc vsource
model isrc isource

vsense (nsense 0) vsrc type="pwl" wave=[0, 0, 99n, 0, 100n, 1, 1u, 1]
i_a2d (nsense 0) isrc type="pwl" file="code:libcosim_bridge.so:vacask_bridge_init:a2d:ain"

control
  analysis tran1 tran step=1n stop=1u
endc
